{
  "label": "Body Config",
  "category": "iso",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Konfigurasi Body Config (Bit Field ISO8583)",
      "id": "details-body-field",
      "intro": "Sub-tab Body Config digunakan untuk mendefinisikan kamus field (bit fields) ISO8583 secara global pada skema ini. Setiap field mewakili elemen data spesifik sesuai standar ISO 8583 (seperti Primary Account Number, Processing Code, atau Transaction Amount) lengkap dengan tipe data dan tipe encoding-nya.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Daftar & Detail Body Config (Bit Fields)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Daftar ini menampilkan kamus bit field ISO8583 yang terdaftar.\n• Informasi kolom tabel meliputi:\n  - **Field Number:** Nomor field ISO (bit 1 hingga 128).\n  - **Description:** Keterangan fungsional field.\n  - **Length:** Panjang data maksimum.\n  - **Data Type:** Karakteristik tipe data (FIXED, LVAR, LLVAR, LLLVAR).\n  - **Encoding Type:** Format encoding field (ASCII, BINARY, EBCDIC, BCD).\n• Klik pada salah satu baris untuk melihat detail lengkap atau melakukan perubahan.",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(99,102,241,.08);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#eef2ff;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#1e1b4b;\">Body Config</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#6366f1;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">+ Add Field</span></div><div style=\"padding:0;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:8.5px;\"><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><td style=\"padding:6px 8px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Field No</td><td style=\"padding:6px 8px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Description</td><td style=\"padding:6px 8px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Type</td><td style=\"padding:6px 8px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Enc</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 8px;color:#1e1b4b;font-weight:700;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">2</td><td style=\"padding:6px 8px;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">Primary Account Number</td><td style=\"padding:6px 8px;color:#4f46e5;font-weight:700;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">LLVAR</td><td style=\"padding:6px 8px;color:#0891b2;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">BCD</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 8px;color:#1e1b4b;font-weight:700;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">3</td><td style=\"padding:6px 8px;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">Processing Code</td><td style=\"padding:6px 8px;color:#4f46e5;font-weight:700;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">FIXED</td><td style=\"padding:6px 8px;color:#0891b2;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">ASCII</td></tr></table></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Form Tambah / Edit Body Config",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\nDrawer form samping kanan berukuran **480px** menyediakan field-field berikut:\n1. **Iso Field Number** *(Wajib)*: Nomor urutan field ISO 8583 (misal `2` untuk PAN, `3` untuk Processing Code).\n2. **Description** *(Wajib)*: Deskripsi fungsional field.\n3. **Length** *(Wajib)*: Panjang maksimal field (dalam karakter atau byte).\n4. **Data Type** *(Wajib)*: Jenis struktur panjang data (pilihan dropdown: `FIXED`, `LVAR`, `LLVAR`, `LLLVAR`).\n5. **Encoding Type** *(Wajib)*: Cara representasi byte dalam pesan socket (pilihan dropdown: `ASCII`, `BINARY`, `EBCDIC`, `BCD`).",
          "color": "#4f46e5",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(99,102,241,.1);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef2ff,#e0e7ff);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#6366f1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M16 18l2-2-2-2\"/><path d=\"M8 6L6 8l2 2\"/><path d=\"M14.5 4l-5 16\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#1e1b4b;\">Create Body Field</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#6366f1;\">Fill in the body field details and save</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:9.5px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Iso Field Number <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Field Name (e.g. 2)</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Description <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Enter description</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Length <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Length</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Data Type <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Choose</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Encoding Type <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Choose</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-top:1px solid #c7d2fe;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#6366f1;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
